WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.886 --> 00:00:05.125
Send &amp; Sign brings secure
compliant e-signatures straight into

2
00:00:05.125 --> 00:00:08.926
SharePoint. Send from the folder
you already work in and the signed

3
00:00:08.926 --> 00:00:11.046
copy comes back to the same
place.

4
00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:16.880
Signing shouldn't mean downloading,
re-uploading, and chasing emails.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.760
Send &amp; Sign is built for IT
admins who want nothing new to

6
00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:25.399
host, for legal teams who need a
clear record, and for sales teams

7
00:00:25.399 --> 00:00:28.840
who need clients to sign fast on
any device.

8
00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:34.958
It's four simple steps. Pick a
PDF from your library, optionally

9
00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:38.118
turn it into an interactive
proposal with Claude,

10
00:00:38.118 --> 00:00:41.878
send it to your signers who
verify with a one-time email code

11
00:00:41.878 --> 00:00:45.678
with no account needed, then the
sealed, signed copy is filed back

12
00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.328
in your folder automatically.

13
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.219
Every envelope is managed from one
hub inside SharePoint. See what's

14
00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:57.300
waiting, what's signed, and what's
expired, without leaving Microsoft

15
00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.220
365 or juggling another login.

16
00:01:01.824 --> 00:01:04.904
Start by choosing the legal
framework, then browse your

17
00:01:04.904 --> 00:01:08.344
SharePoint sites and libraries to
find the document.

18
00:01:08.344 --> 00:01:11.174
Send it as it is or transform it
with Claude.

19
00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:18.011
Transform turns a static PDF into a live,
interactive document. Choose from four layouts.

20
00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:23.922
Your figures and clauses stay word for word,
and you can adjust the structure

21
00:01:23.922 --> 00:01:27.300
with plain-English instructions.
The PDF never leaves SharePoint.

22
00:01:28.853 --> 00:01:32.893
Before anything is sent, check it.
The built-in accuracy check

23
00:01:32.893 --> 00:01:36.292
compares the new version against
the original. Preview it on

24
00:01:36.292 --> 00:01:40.293
desktop, tablet and mobile, then
give your final sign-off.

25
00:01:41.811 --> 00:01:45.611
Your clients get a document they
can actually read on a phone. No

26
00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:49.931
pinching and zooming, collapsible
schedules to keep terms tidy, and

27
00:01:49.931 --> 00:01:52.601
optional items they can choose
before signing.

28
00:01:54.459 --> 00:01:58.859
Need more than one signature? Send
up to 20 signers all at once or

29
00:01:58.859 --> 00:02:02.589
in a set order and add a cover
note to guide each recipient.

30
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:09.687
Speed matters. Most clients sign on their
phone in about sixty seconds. They tap a

31
00:02:09.687 --> 00:02:14.900
secure link, enter the code from their email,
and sign, with no account and no app.

32
00:02:16.465 --> 00:02:20.865
On mobile, it's three steps.
Verify with the email code, review

33
00:02:20.865 --> 00:02:24.425
the document and tap where your
signature goes. Then draw your

34
00:02:24.425 --> 00:02:27.535
signature and confirm and the
document is sealed.

35
00:02:28.871 --> 00:02:32.710
When the last person signs, every
copy gets a tamper-evident digital

36
00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:35.911
fingerprint and a full audit
certificate.

37
00:02:35.911 --> 00:02:38.741
Everyone receives the signed PDF
by email.

38
00:02:40.542 --> 00:02:44.022
And there's no filing to do. The
unsigned draft stays in your

39
00:02:44.022 --> 00:02:47.542
client's folder and the signed
copy appears right beside it,

40
00:02:47.542 --> 00:02:48.732
ready when you need it.

41
00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:55.120
Send &amp; Sign is designed around Australia's
Electronic Transactions Act.

42
00:02:55.300 --> 00:03:00.000
Your documents live in SharePoint,
external signers never get access to your tenant,

43
00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.510
and every agreement has a tamper-evident audit trail.

44
00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:09.230
Send from SharePoint. Get them
signed back into SharePoint.

45
00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:13.470
Experience calm, compliant
electronic signatures built

46
00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:17.410
specifically for your Microsoft 365
environment.
